cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite the paper that describes it
  (preferred citation below).
title: "fvcStructureRangeland3D: 2D-to-3D label transfer and 3D vegetation model benchmarking for rangelands"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Sotomayor
    given-names: Laura N.
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-9791-2193"
    affiliation: University of Tasmania
version: "0.1.1"
date-released: "2026-11-28"
abstract: >-
  Python software and workflow for transferring 2D vegetation growth-form
  labels into georeferenced 3D UAS LiDAR point clouds (fvc3d package), and for
  preparing the labelled tiles used to benchmark 3D vegetation models in
  semi-arid rangelands.
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/LNSOTOM/fvc_structure"
url: "https://lnsotom.github.io/fvc_structure/"
keywords:
  - UAS LiDAR
  - label transfer
  - 3D point cloud segmentation
  - ForestFormer3D
  - rangeland
references:
